window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When the gods war, no one wins.</b></p> <p>My three messengers took a greater risk than I realized when they agreed to help me save my village. Now, they must face the consequences, and so must I.</p> <p>If Kaius and Zelus go to war, it will devastate humanity...and that's not the only danger that lurks on the horizon.</p> <p>But despite the threat to our existence, the bond between me and my soulkeepers continues to deepen into something far beyond what I ever expected.</p> <p>I promised myself I wouldn't fall in love with these three beautiful, mysterious men.</p> <p>I'm beginning to think it's too late for that.</p> <p><b>Note: </b><b><i>Defiance </i></b><b>is the second book in the Her Soulkeepers series, a medium-burn reverse harem fantasy with steam, action, and romance that will melt your heart and your panties.</b></p>"; 
